## Article Collection

The survey is based on a collection of approximately 100 research articles concerning metal oxide nanoparticles.

Each article is assigned a unique article number and is examined individually for information related to nanoparticle characterization. The collected information includes structural, morphological, optical, spectroscopic, thermal, surface, magnetic, and particle-size-related properties.

The articles are being systematically reviewed and their characterization information is being cross-checked against the original publications. The article collection is organized to maintain consistent article identification across the different characterization datasets and comparison tables.

Copyrighted full-text articles are not included in this repository. Bibliographic information may be added separately where appropriate.
